            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae waawutmo Merodak-baladan, garmoó Baladani, waawutmoó Babuloni ngiwa axaás adór Hesekia ira tiíq, nee adór ira huunguú/, guri ya/abuuseérí ya/aáw kuwa barwito'órí huwi nee qeemu dimbadimbé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Hesekia mukdá' guri dahi'ís, do'oduú peésa kay baabatsi guri dir'íní laqán, peésa gari laqán nee sahaábuwo nee muruú ta naanúr tsu'umaamisi, nee di/tá tlaxo gawit, nee xooslár slaqwara sleémeero tidá' baraá do'ósí dirii'. Gár aa meetiís laqaamaro i káhh, ar baraá yaamuwose sa dawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo aarusmo Isaya iri amór waawutmo Hesekia káy, guri báy, «Mukwí gár i kaahi a milá? Nee amór ni dahhiya' a amá niwa dirógí hardihiyé'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia iri oó', «Mukwí amór i dahhi ka ló'wa saaw. A baraá yaamaá Babuloni.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
